|description={{en|1=Coat of arms of Sir [[:en:Richard Williams (alias Cromwell)|Richard Cromwell (alias Williams)]] (c.1510-1544): ''Gules, three chevronels Argent, over all three lions rampant Or, armed and langued Azure.''<br> 
Crest: A demi-lion rampant Or, charged with three chevronels Gules, holding between the paws a plummet Azure.<br>

References:
